// Clue Name :
"P3985767938" "Prisoner Transfer List"
// DetailString :
"P3893056489" "This is a list of the latest prisoners transferred to the Zig in Paragon City."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeOneClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P114203378" "The Zig List"
// DetailString :
"P3218703658" "It all started when Arachnos Operative Wellman asked you to acquire the latest list of prisoner transfers to the Zig. To do this you needed to break into a nearby Longbow base to download the list off one of their computers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeTwoClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1735378621" "Jailbreak!"
// DetailString :
"P4045871228" "It all started when Arachnos Operative Wellman asked you to acquire the latest list of prisoner transfers to the Zig. To do this you needed to break into a nearby Longbow base to download the list off one of their computers.<br><br>Arachnos reviewed the list of new prisoners in the Zig. In addition to the regular criminal minions, there were three villains in particular that Lord Recluse thought would prove useful: Void Ripper, Nexus 99, and Blunt Trauma. An advance agent started a riot in the Zig while you attempted to bust out the villains."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SouvenirZigGuardHat 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P727380727" "Zig Guard Hat"
// tDetailString :
"P3583715112" "This is a security guard hat taken from one of the Zigursky prison guards. You picked it up in a tale you like to call:<br><br><b>Breakout at the Zig</b><br><br>It all started when Arachnos Operative Wellman asked you to acquire the latest list of prisoner transfers to the Zig. To do this you needed to break into a nearby Longbow base to download the list off one of their computers.<br><br>Arachnos reviewed the list of new prisoners in the Zig. In addition to the regular criminal minions, there were three villains in particular that Lord Recluse thought would prove useful: Void Ripper, Nexus 99, and Blunt Trauma. An advance agent started a riot in the Zig while you attempted to bust out the villains.<br><br>The prisoners were smuggled into a cargo ship to take them to Mercy Island. However, Longbow managed to track down the vessel at sea and secure it for transport back to the Zig. You had to board the cargo ship and defeat all the Longbow agents there.  In the end, the cargo ship reached Mercy Island where the prisoners met their new life in the Rogue Isles."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P431740371" "You know the Zig back in Paragon City? Of course you do - you seem the type. We'd like to get the latest on who's been shipped there recently. If there are some inmates that seem promising, we'd like to free them from incarceration, if you know what I'm saying.<br><br>First off, we need to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>break into a nearby Longbow base and get the latest list of prisoners recently transferred to the Zig</A>. From there, we'll decide who's worth liberating."
// AcceptString :
"P1468076124" "Steal the prisoner transfer list"
// SendOffString :
"P4046979181" "Here's the latest passcodes we've acquired from captured Longbow agents. They should get you into the Longbow base, but from there you're on your own.<br><br>I've commandeered a sub here at the docks. Use it get to the underwater Longbow base."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3601081232" "What are you waiting for, {VillainName}? Get that prisoner transfer list!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3692388899" "You enter the underwater base from the airlock and breathe in the recycled air."

