// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2878800877" "We checked out the prisoner transfer list that you stole from that Longbow base and we came up with some likely candidates. There's a bunch of criminals there that'd make good henchman material - one can never be too short on those. There's three prisoners Lord Recluse feels might prove particularly useful: Void Ripper, Nexus 99, and Blunt Trauma. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We'll send in an advance agent to start a riot in the facility, then you can go in and break the prisoners out of the Zig.</A><br><br>Note that if you fail to return at least one of these villains, this mission will be deemed a failure in the eyes of Arachnos."
// AcceptString :
"P2268550891" "Break prisoners out of the Zig"
// SendOffString :
"P2301000707" "We'll have an Arachnos Flyer ready to take you into the Zig proper. When you get there, make your way to the sewer entrance near the back. We have an Arachnos Operative waiting inside the sewer system ready to assist you.<br><br>As soon as you bust the prisoners out of the Zig we'll have a cargo ship waiting to take them to Mercy Isle."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2293949200" "Get going! Our agent is waiting for you at the Zig!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1009881184" "The shouts of rioting prisoners fill the air. Chaos reigns within the Zig."

