// Task - Mission_3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P60163982" "While you were trying to break those villains out the Zig, our Arachnos Operatives were loading up a cargo ship full of the mundane prisoners. We thought we were in the clear, but Longbow managed to track the cargo ship we were using to smuggle them to the Rogue Isles. The cargo ship has been taken over by Longbow agents trying to recover the prisoners. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to that ship and defeat all the Longbow agents</A>."
// AcceptString :
"P2139192809" "Defeat all Longbow agents"
// SendOffString :
"P85133228" "Crush those Longbow meddlers. All of them."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2235826484" "What are you doing here? There's Longbow agents to crush!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P176893261" "The vessel rocks in the high ocean waves."

